  {
   "key": "scene_01",
   "text": "Allianz Arena, Munich. A Friday night in the Bundesliga, round 10. Four weeks ago, Vincent Kompany collapsed at Bayern's training ground. He spent five days in hospital, then went home to rest. While he was away, his assistant Aaron Danks took the team for five matches: four wins and a draw. Tonight, Kompany is back on the touchline. Their visitors, 1. FC Köln, have won one of their last five, and lost two. The final score is 1-1. But a 1-1 can hide a very different story. Who really controlled this match... and who should have won it?",
