  {
   "key": "scene_03",
   "text": "Kompany is the coach Bayern chose in 2024 to follow Thomas Tuchel. At his presentation he made one promise. Bayern players should be brave and have personality on the ball. Since then, bundesliga.com says, he has given senior debuts to more than 10 youngsters. That is the yardstick tonight. At the front of that plan, Harry Kane, who leads the line in a 4-2-3-1. On the other side, Mikey Moore, a Köln midfielder in a 3-5-1-1 built to hit on the break.",
