   "key": "scene_04",
   "text": "Allianz Arena. Minute 12. Köln break. Saïd El Mala finds Mikey Moore. Moore finishes with his right foot. 0-1. This is the fast break Wagner described. Bayern answer by taking over. By FotMob's momentum measure, they are on top for 83 percent of the first half. Minute 37. Tom Bischof's pass, and Nathaniel Brown scores with his left foot, from open play. 1-1. But the level score hides a bigger imbalance.",
