   "key": "scene_05",
   "text": "Minute 51. Köln break again. Moore shoots from inside the box, and Jonas Urbig saves. A goal here makes it 1-2. Urbig makes 3 saves in the match, 2 of them diving, and each one keeps the score level. Our reading: this is where the match could have tipped. The turning point is not a goal. It is a save.",
