  {
   "key": "scene_06",
   "text": "After the break, Bayern keep pushing and Köln keep defending. Jonathan Tah, the highest-rated starter, wins all 4 of his ground duels. Harry Kane is the lowest-rated Bayern starter. But he was substituted after only 9 touches, so it is a short sample, not a verdict. Bayern keep 72 percent of the ball. Köln make 32 tackles to their 14. That points to a side happy to defend, then break.",
