  {
   "key": "scene_08",
   "text": "Sportschau writes, in translation, \"Bayern had to reorganise after the break, while Köln kept up an almost faultless performance.\" The numbers back the defending, though with 3 big chances missed, not faultless in front of goal. After the match Kompany said, in translation: \"I believe the result was fair and Köln deserved it.\" Then: \"But those are no excuses.\" AP writes: \"Both sides had chances in a busy second half but it remained goalless and the point was enough for Bayern to edge a point ahead of Borussia Dortmund.\" That is the table's view. The chances say Köln deserved more.",
